{"id":"vod_bf_88949","vodId":"88949","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"魔域英雄传说","name_cn":"魔域英雄传说","date":"2025-01-01","year":"2025","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20250214-1/92ab6dee41c20146334d3cf3a329dcd0.jpg"},"summary":"被称为“最凶恶的黑暗幻想作品”，描写主角凯因谢尔的壮大复仇剧。　　故事发生在七英雄封印黑暗异邦，为帝国带来和平的 20 年后。边境王领地附近的国境，正在展开新的骚乱。此时，突然出现一名边境英雄剑士凯因谢尔，以巨大的黑色之剑惩奸除恶。他的真实身分是 20 年前被冠上背叛者污名而被暗杀的“圣枪叛徒”其中一人“亚谢里德”。他的目的只有一个：向笑着杀死伙伴，夺走封印黑暗异邦功劳的真正背叛者“七英雄”复仇。随着时代变迁，帝国靠著七英雄的荣光和治理恢复成安定的世界。为了暗杀他们，或许会让帝国再次陷入不安的危机当中。尽管如此，凯因谢尔依旧持续他的暗杀旅程。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-03 15:23:06","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/moyuyingxiongchuanshuo/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/moyuyingxiongchuanshuo/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/moyuyingxiongchuanshuo/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/moyuyingxiongchuanshuo/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/moyuyingxiongchuanshuo/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/moyuyingxiongchuanshuo/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/moyuyingxiongchuanshuo/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/moyuyingxiongchuanshuo/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/moyuyingxiongchuanshuo/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/moyuyingxiongchuanshuo/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/moyuyingxiongchuanshuo/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/moyuyingxiongchuanshuo/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:57:34.710Z"}